18:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The scroll-speed gap is solvable. It does not require a complete rebuild - it requires understanding that TikTok traffic and Google traffic are different psychological contracts, and designing the above-fold experience accordingly. Fix the structural mismatch, validate with real mobile scroll-depth data, then scale with confidence."}]
